[[Rockshot Devourer]]s are [[ranger]]s who use [[trap]]s and interruptions to shutdown the enemy rather than inflict massive damage. They tend to burrow underground, but if they are patroling you can expect to encounter their traps within their patrol area which will inflict blind and burning. They can often be found with [[Jade Scarab]]s.

